**When embedding multiline strings (JavaScript, SQL, etc.), use raw string
literals (`R"()"`) instead of escaping each line.**

```cpp
// ❌ WRONG
const char kScript[] =
    "(function() {\n"
    "  let x = 1;\n"
    "})();";

// ✅ CORRECT
const char kScript[] = R"(
  (function() {
    let x = 1;
  })();
)";
```

